# Admin app (`@pakfactory/admin`)

When editing **`apps/admin/`**, follow [`apps/admin/AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and repo [`AGENTS.md`](../../../../AGENTS.md).

**Quick rules:**

- **Scope:** internal staff sign-in + read-only buyer request views (PROD-2405). Not content editing (Studio) or buyer marketing (www).
- **PR base:** `www-new-release`.
- **Auth:** real Supabase; mock internal-account + request reads until PROD-2414/2415 (`ADMIN_DATA_SOURCE=mock` default).
- **Dev bypass:** `ADMIN_DEV_BYPASS` — local only, never production or shared preview deploys.
- **Packages:** `@pakfactory/domain`, `@pakfactory/supabase`, `@pakfactory/auth-ui`, `@pakfactory/ui` — no Sanity.
- **Env:** Supabase in root `.env.local`; admin overrides in `apps/admin/.env.local` — see [`.env.example`](../../.env.example).
- **Local dev:** `pnpm dev:admin` → port **4000**.
- **Cookie collisions:** admin and www share `localhost` Supabase cookies — see AGENTS.md troubleshooting for HTTP 431 recovery.
